{
  "title": "Egyptian Chocolate Bowl",
  "description": "A rich and creamy Egyptian dessert featuring plain chocolate, served in a stone bowl, and low in carbs. This dish is a crowd-pleaser and perfect for any occasion.",
  "cuisine": "Egyptian",
